+
+  // ---- decision story band (Act 1) --------------------------------------
+  // Always shown when a decision record exists; renders after the group band and
+  // before the offers region. Recipe copied verbatim from mockup-mdm-states.html
+  // (.story .. .ai-more), with the mockup's --rp-fw-* tokens resolved to the
+  // literal weights this file already uses. Own background + border-bottom so the
+  // band stands on its own.
+  .story {
+    background: var(--rp-bg-000);
